{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06773","headline":"风凉原上作 · 王昌龄","name":"风凉原上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴岑宿云归，烟雾湿松柏。\n风凄日初晓，下岭望川泽。\n远山无晦明，秋水千里白。\n佳气盘未央，圣人在凝碧。\n关门阻天下，信是帝王宅。\n海内方晏然，庙堂有奇策。\n时贞守全运，罢去游说客。\n予忝兰台人，幽寻免贻责。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}